  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Earthquakes without frontiers: a partnership for increasing resilience to seismic hazard in the continents</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing countries are particularly vulnerable to the economic and social costs of natural hazards. This interdisciplinary programme aims to reduce risk in these earthquake-prone and volcanic regions by increasing resilience to high impact events.</narrative>
